The firsttext is "great".
The secondtext is "rgeat".
The size is 5.
The width is 6.
The table is a list of 150 zeros.
For every first from 0 to 4.
For every second from 0 to 4.
If character first of firsttext is character second of secondtext, set item ((first times 5 plus second) times 6 plus 1) of table to 1.

For every length from 2 to 5.
For every first from 0 to (5 minus length).
For every second from 0 to (5 minus length).
For every split from 1 to length minus 1.
The base is (first times 5 plus second) times 6.
The splitindex is base plus split.
The noother is (first plus split) times 5 plus second plus split.
The nootherindex is noother times 6 plus length minus split.
The swapother is first times 5 plus second plus length minus split.
The swapotherindex is swapother times 6 plus split.
The swapbase is (first plus split) times 5 plus second.
The swapbaseindex is swapbase times 6 plus length minus split.
The noswap is 0.
If item splitindex of table is 1 and item nootherindex of table is 1, set noswap to 1.
The withswap is 0.
If item swapotherindex of table is 1 and item swapbaseindex of table is 1, set withswap to 1.
The fullindex is base plus length.
If noswap is 1 or withswap is 1, set item fullindex of table to 1.

If item 5 of table is 1, show true.
Otherwise, show false.
